## Local databases and design-time artifacts
## The real, persistent database lives outside the repo (see setup guide
## section 8) — nothing named food.db should ever end up in here anyway,
## but this also catches any *.db created by the design-time factory or
## ad-hoc local testing.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
design_time.db

## User-specific project files that shouldn't be shared between machines
*.userprefs

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Avalonia / Rider preview cache
*.AvaloniaPreviewer/

## Secrets — nothing here yet, but if appsettings.Development.json or a
## local secrets file ever appears, keep it out from the start rather than
## remembering to add it after the fact.
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json
